<li>Yellowstone cutthroat trout</li>
<li>Utah sucker</li>
<li>Longnose dace</li>
<li>Redside shiner</li>
<li>Paiute sculpin</li>
<li>Mountain whitefish</li>
<li>Speckled dace</li>
<li>Mountain sucker</li>
<li>Mottled sculpin</li>
<li>Utah chub</li>
<li>Bluehead sucker</li>
<li>Leatherside chub</li>
</ul>
Lain spésiés asli:
<ul>
